PHYSICAL ORG OF A DATA CENTRE
 
its built like a supermarket aisle but racks have servers, storage devices, network equipments

uses a two tier network topology

cooling system
Working of the cooling system
1. Cold air is supplied to the front-facing aisles of server racks.
2. Server fans draw the cold air through the equipment.
3. The air absorbs heat from the servers.
4. Hot air leaves from the rear of the racks.
5. The hot air is directed toward cooling equipment, where it is cooled and circulated again

